  "_note": "ATtiny2313 8-bit AVR MCU. Pin table audited against Microchip ATtiny2313A datasheet (DS40001894). DIP-20 package. 2 KB flash, 128 B SRAM, 128 B EEPROM, 8 MHz internal RC. Ports A (PA0-PA2), B (PB0-PB7), D (PD0-PD6). PA2 = RESET (active low). PA0/PA1 = XTAL1/XTAL2. PD0/PD1 = RXD/TXD (hardware UART). No ADC. Timer0 8-bit (OC0A on PB2, OC0B on PD5), Timer1 16-bit (OC1A on PB3, OC1B on PB4). INT0 on PD2, INT1 on PD3. Pin names match bw-board terminal spelling contract: lowercase pXn.",
